                "text": "President Trump says he \u201ctook care of Medicaid.\u201d He did \u2014 by cutting it. The Big Beautiful Bill slashes coverage, adds red tape, and raises costs for millions of Americans who depend on it. https://t.co/bf9033pHGE",
