                "text": "After the longest shutdown in American history, I'm sure you have questions. What's next in the fight for affordable healthcare? What happens when the new CR runs out in January?\n\nJoin me on Wednesday, November 19th for a telephone town hall where I will take your questions on what's happening in Washington.",
